WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.301 --> 00:00:01.126
SCOTT LANG
I just think you should get

00:00:01.177 --> 00:00:02.476
to have a normal life.

00:00:02.527 --> 00:00:04.317
CASSIE LANG
Dad, a guy dressed like a bee

00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:06.111
tried to kill me in my
room when I was six.

00:00:06.399 --> 00:00:07.769
YOUNG CASSIE LANG
Daddy is that you?

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:08.563
SCOTT LANG
Hi Peanut.

00:00:09.605 --> 00:00:11.698
KATHRYN NEWTON
Cassie Lang wants to change the world.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:13.944
CASSIE LANG
I have a suit.

00:00:13.995 --> 00:00:14.667
[Yell]

00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:16.166
SCOTT LANG
Yeah, I noticed.

00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:17.623
KATHRYN NEWTON
She likes the chaos,

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:20.353
she wants to be fighting, and she
wants to be in the middle of it.

00:00:20.404 --> 00:00:23.480
She's being influenced by these
superheroes around her.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:25.817
CASSIE LANG
You know, if I had something like this

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:28.535
when you were gone,
I could've found you.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.171
SCOTT LANG
Cassie!

00:00:32.737 --> 00:00:33.655
CASSIE LANG
I'm sorry.

00:00:34.504 --> 00:00:35.353
Dad!

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:37.076
PAUL RUDD
It was fun watching Kathryn

00:00:37.127 --> 00:00:38.327
take on Cassie.

00:00:39.058 --> 00:00:41.052
MICHELLE PFEIFFER
She just shows up and she's just got it.

00:00:42.965 --> 00:00:45.208
JONATHAN MAJORS
The buoyant energy of her character

00:00:45.259 --> 00:00:46.259
is so great.

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:47.738
KATHRYN NEWTON
She just wants to be a superhero

00:00:47.789 --> 00:00:49.992
like her dad. She wants
to impress him.

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:51.888
SCOTT LANG
Momentum, right?  Jump, tap.

00:00:51.939 --> 00:00:53.023
CASSIE LANG
I know how to do it, dad.

00:00:53.074 --> 00:00:53.968
SCOTT LANG
Oh, do you?

